## Installation

```bash
go get {{.ModulePath}}
```

Add a blank import to your application, e.g. in `providers/packages.go`:

```go
package providers

import (
	_ "{{.ModulePath}}"
)
```

Then run the migrations:

```bash
go run main.go console db:up
```

